{"availability":"available","full":"agentprojectcontext/apx","name":"apx","description":"Meet your crew. APX is an open-source Agent OS for running AI agents on your own machine — memory in plain files, agents that work together, Claude Code, Codex, Telegram, WhatsApp and MCP.","category":"Developer tools","language":"JavaScript","stars":13,"forks":2,"created":"2026-05-08T14:22:05Z","updated":"2026-10-07T12:55:00Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://agentprojectcontext.github.io/apx/","topics":["agent-os","agents-md","ai-agents","claude-code","cli","codex","llm","local-first","mcp","multi-agent","nodejs","open-source","self-hosted","telegram-bot","whatsapp"],"demo":"https://agentprojectcontext.github.io/apx/","color":"#302e55","ink":"#dbd2ff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-08T12:58:59.955Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-08T12:58:59.955Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-08T12:58:59.955Z","lastDemoCheckedAt":"2026-10-08T12:58:59.955Z","discoveredVia":[],"metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-08T12:58:59.955Z","stars":13,"forks":2}],"technologies":["Node.js"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["APX is an open-source Agent OS: your own team of AI agents, running on your machine.","Give them roles, memory and tools. Talk to them, let them work together, and follow what they do.","Research, writing, everyday plans, business operations or code — build a crew around your life and work."],"features":["Keep a crew for each part of your work. A researcher, a writer, an organizer or a coding agent: choose the roles you need and group them by project.","Give work to the team. Start a group chat, mention an agent in a task, and follow its reply. Agents can ask each other for help.","Put recurring work on a schedule. Daily briefings, reports and check-ins can run as routines while APX stays running.","Reach the same crew from different places. Use the web panel, Telegram, WhatsApp or your phone; your agents keep their roles and access to their tools.","Bring your models and tools. Connect model providers, local Ollama models, skills and MCP servers. For coding work, delegate to Claude Code, Codex or another supported CLI."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/agentprojectcontext/apx/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"54b1a11b9124cfcc548944630e733bdee9301df25a0fda2b9e234d3e74467779","extractedAt":"2026-10-08T12:58:59.955Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-08T12:58:59.955Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"APX is an open-source Agent OS: your own team of AI agents, running on your machine.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/agentprojectcontext/apx/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[],"fingerprint":"54b1a11b9124cfcc548944630e733bdee9301df25a0fda2b9e234d3e74467779","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/agentprojectcontext/apx/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-08T12:58:59.955Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-07T12:55:00Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/agentprojectcontext/apx/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-08T12:58:59.955Z","hash":"54b1a11b9124cfcc548944630e733bdee9301df25a0fda2b9e234d3e74467779","originalBytes":11245,"storedBytes":11245,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["apx","agent","work","panel","project","cli","code","core","crew","phone","conversations","local","main","web","desktop","one","routines","agents","android","browser","channels","coding","runtime","skills","apc","codex","models","own","run","sessions","start","tasks","them","tools","tools.","access","app","connected","follow","install","messaging","need","real","roles","telegram","what","add","agents.md","another","application","around","channel","chat","claude-code","commands","connect","context","crew.","each","exec","experience","external","group","installation","make","memory","model","outside","providers","require","running","runs","see","specialists","take","their","through","together","voice","watch","actions","aider","alongside","already","antigravity","apps","apx.","ask","ass